```

Equivalent seconds comparison:

```js
if (Math.floor(Date.now() / 1000) >= payload.exp) {
  // expired
}
```

Use `>=`: token becomes invalid at `exp`, not only after it. Never trust `jwt.decode()` alone; it does not verify signature.

